  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Your laptop deserves better than being wedged between a granola bar and yesterday's meeting notes. Our Tatum tote bag in pebbled leather keeps things sorted with a padded center compartment and interior zip pocket—it handles a full day without making it obvious. (The granola bar can stay.)</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled Leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (black, red jam, southwest desert); silver hardware (dusk rose)</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap drop: 11.75&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Snap closure with center zip compartment</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 13&quot; (L) x 12.25&quot; (H) x 8.13&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
